(4681264, 676185, 4967, '<td valign="top">Great story here... I feel like technically the photo could have been done a bit better. The slight tilt of the horizon especially bothers me... I also wish the girl had been closer so you could have seen her better... as my eyes go right to the sign, and she''s an afterthought.</td>', 'Great story here... I feel like technically the photo could have been done a bit better. The slight tilt of the horizon especially bothers me... I also wish the girl had been closer so you could have seen her better... as my eyes go right to the sign, and she''s an afterthought.', '2008-05-05 09:35:34.000000', NULL, 1),
