(4681509, 676208, 20577, '<td valign="top">I don''t think this baby really cries light. If he did, he would be from another planet or maybe even another galaxy. Humans don''t cry light, so this isn''t really believable as a story, unless it was a comic book, but that isn''t the title of the challenge. Nice try... oh yeah, the picture is too dark...</td>', 'I don''t think this baby really cries light. If he did, he would be from another planet or maybe even another galaxy. Humans don''t cry light, so this isn''t really believable as a story, unless it was a comic book, but that isn''t the title of the challenge. Nice try... oh yeah, the picture is too dark...', '2008-05-05 10:56:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4681519, 675261, 29011, '<td valign="top">So this is what happened after you got in the slammer. Oh boy. Could probably find you a job with the big man up in the north....<br/>Great shot Tim or Aimee, hehe. Really, this is a great 3rd shot of the series of the story :) No technical nitpicks, just all praise this time.</td>', 'So this is what happened after you got in the slammer. Oh boy. Could probably find you a job with the big man up in the north....Great shot Tim or Aimee, hehe. Really, this is a great 3rd shot of the series of the story :) No technical nitpicks, just all praise this time.', '2008-05-05 10:59:37.000000', NULL, 1),
