(4681800, 675770, 66635, '<td valign="top">I used to work with a butcher who was missing several fingers.  He used to smoke cigarettes between his stubs!  I always wondered what became of the lost fingers!</td>', 'I used to work with a butcher who was missing several fingers.  He used to smoke cigarettes between his stubs!  I always wondered what became of the lost fingers!', '2008-05-05 13:00:05.000000', NULL, 1),
