(4681813, 676224, 66635, '<td valign="top">Funky editing.  Not sure what the actual story is other than that these guys are filming a story.  But it would be better if you could also tell what story they are capturing.</td>', 'Funky editing.  Not sure what the actual story is other than that these guys are filming a story.  But it would be better if you could also tell what story they are capturing.', '2008-05-05 13:02:05.000000', NULL, 1),
