(4681823, 675973, 33535, '<td valign="top">wow, this is making my mind spinning like hell! lol<br/>very awesome lighting and story telling.<br/>i know some folks will vote this down for the "sex sells" factor so i''ll compensate those by giving you a 10 and for the pure guts to submit sumpn like this on a rather "conservative" site like dpc ;)<br/>(by toyan?)</td>', 'wow, this is making my mind spinning like hell! lolvery awesome lighting and story telling.i know some folks will vote this down for the "sex sells" factor so i''ll compensate those by giving you a 10 and for the pure guts to submit sumpn like this on a rather "conservative" site like dpc ;)(by toyan?)', '2008-05-05 13:05:03.000000', NULL, 1),
