(4681965, 676136, 66635, '<td valign="top">My only issue with this is that it is a picture of a picture.  The person who made the stained glass told the story and you took a picture of it.</td>', 'My only issue with this is that it is a picture of a picture.  The person who made the stained glass told the story and you took a picture of it.', '2008-05-05 14:32:34.000000', NULL, 1),
