(4683061, 676129, 54645, '<td valign="top">As a Neurologist, I never condone motorcycle riding! ;) At least he has a helmet and it''s a Bimmer. On to the photo, this is an exciting composition, movement in the tire, smoke, tack sharp bike (great job!), and pleasure in the background fans. I tend to not like shots like this due to ugly background structures (i.e. the building, top of the car), but you captured my attention. BTW, the only sign of rain is the wet front tire. 7</td>', 'As a Neurologist, I never condone motorcycle riding! ;) At least he has a helmet and it''s a Bimmer. On to the photo, this is an exciting composition, movement in the tire, smoke, tack sharp bike (great job!), and pleasure in the background fans. I tend to not like shots like this due to ugly background structures (i.e. the building, top of the car), but you captured my attention. BTW, the only sign of rain is the wet front tire. 7', '2008-05-05 23:21:10.000000', NULL, 1),
