(4685593, 675622, 53316, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is really good. I am imagining an entire story to go with this! I wish the skin tones were a bit less red but otherwise it''s very nice.</td>', 'Wow, this is really good. I am imagining an entire story to go with this! I wish the skin tones were a bit less red but otherwise it''s very nice.', '2008-05-07 00:46:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4685596, 674352, 53316, '<td valign="top">Sad, and the title makes it even sadder.  I wish maybe the background were plainer, as it would seem more real to me, like it were at a garage sale instead of seeming more like a still life. But, that would have detracted from the soft beauty of the image. All in all a great job and I do hope that this is not a personal story for you or your loved ones.</td>', 'Sad, and the title makes it even sadder.  I wish maybe the background were plainer, as it would seem more real to me, like it were at a garage sale instead of seeming more like a still life. But, that would have detracted from the soft beauty of the image. All in all a great job and I do hope that this is not a personal story for you or your loved ones.', '2008-05-07 00:48:36.000000', NULL, 1),
