(4691361, 675912, 75386, '<td valign="top">Great work! <br/>This does say a story (finally one that does!)<br/>The backlighting is perfect for this but even more so is the positioning, which  places the child on the top of the world for a moment.  It gives a message that this is a story that most children experience(which is why the sillouette works so well as it keeps the face unknown and hence can be anyone), one of winning a game, of the satisfaction of accomplishment.<br/> <br/>this deserves a ribbon for sure <br/>10</td>', 'Great work! This does say a story (finally one that does!)The backlighting is perfect for this but even more so is the positioning, which  places the child on the top of the world for a moment.  It gives a message that this is a story that most children experience(which is why the sillouette works so well as it keeps the face unknown and hence can be anyone), one of winning a game, of the satisfaction of accomplishment. this deserves a ribbon for sure 10', '2008-05-08 22:29:57.000000', NULL, 1),
