(4692656, 676107, 50695, '<td valign="top">He knew that was the tree. He had studied it so carefully. Two thick branches separating from the trunk and then crossing back over each other; a knot the shape of an upside-down heart; rough, flaking bark; small pale leaves; and of course the roots plunging into the earth. The largest one pointed to a rock five feet away, a rock that was now upended like a sad turtle. Yes, that was the rock and that was the tree. But where was the body? He stood up and walked further into the woods, looking for another tree exactly like it, or at least a place to hide.</td>', 'He knew that was the tree. He had studied it so carefully. Two thick branches separating from the trunk and then crossing back over each other; a knot the shape of an upside-down heart; rough, flaking bark; small pale leaves; and of course the roots plunging into the earth. The largest one pointed to a rock five feet away, a rock that was now upended like a sad turtle. Yes, that was the rock and that was the tree. But where was the body? He stood up and walked further into the woods, looking for another tree exactly like it, or at least a place to hide.', '2008-05-09 13:38:36.000000', NULL, 1),
