(4693345, 676203, 12661, '<td valign="top">The color and lighting is excellent in this photograph. Composition wise, I think I would have preferred more sky and less ground. Although both components have a strong interest, I personally like the cloud more than the texture of the field.</td>', 'The color and lighting is excellent in this photograph. Composition wise, I think I would have preferred more sky and less ground. Although both components have a strong interest, I personally like the cloud more than the texture of the field.', '2008-05-09 22:49:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4693350, 675973, 12661, '<td valign="top">Based on this image alone, I would guess that your mindless snapshots are better than my ''masterpieces''. As such, I feel awkward criticizing, but I don''t particularly like the way the camera disappears into the background. Also, the shiny fabric between the two models is a bit of a distraction. Aside from that, excellent photograph. Particularly the softness and color of the models.</td>', 'Based on this image alone, I would guess that your mindless snapshots are better than my ''masterpieces''. As such, I feel awkward criticizing, but I don''t particularly like the way the camera disappears into the background. Also, the shiny fabric between the two models is a bit of a distraction. Aside from that, excellent photograph. Particularly the softness and color of the models.', '2008-05-09 22:55:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4693353, 676188, 12661, '<td valign="top">The sky is spectacular and I like the choice of having it occupy a large percentage of the scene. The foreground, however, looks a bit off. Too much contrast perhaps?</td>', 'The sky is spectacular and I like the choice of having it occupy a large percentage of the scene. The foreground, however, looks a bit off. Too much contrast perhaps?', '2008-05-09 22:58:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4693359, 675900, 12661, '<td valign="top">Excellent lighting and amazing sharpness on the dog. The beer label, on the other hand, is a bit distracting to me. The glare is washing out some of the writing. Personally, any time there is writing in a photograph, my attention immediately goes to reading it. If it isn''t clear, I spend time trying to interpolate the washed out parts (or focusing the blurry parts in other cases). In doing that, it takes a while for my attention to shift back to what the photographer really wanted to show me. In this photograph, when my attention shifted back, nothing but greatness.</td>', 'Excellent lighting and amazing sharpness on the dog. The beer label, on the other hand, is a bit distracting to me. The glare is washing out some of the writing. Personally, any time there is writing in a photograph, my attention immediately goes to reading it. If it isn''t clear, I spend time trying to interpolate the washed out parts (or focusing the blurry parts in other cases). In doing that, it takes a while for my attention to shift back to what the photographer really wanted to show me. In this photograph, when my attention shifted back, nothing but greatness.', '2008-05-09 23:05:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4693364, 676204, 12661, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition of this photograph. The cones bring my attention up and the exhaust line bring my attention left... in either case, right back to the plane. Very good use of leading lines. If the rudder wasn''t obscured by one of the cones it could have been better. But something tells me the plane was moving rather quickly.</td>', 'I really like the composition of this photograph. The cones bring my attention up and the exhaust line bring my attention left... in either case, right back to the plane. Very good use of leading lines. If the rudder wasn''t obscured by one of the cones it could have been better. But something tells me the plane was moving rather quickly.', '2008-05-09 23:10:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4693384, 674652, 12661, '<td valign="top">Not sure what the story is in this picture, however, I could easy see this photograph gracing the cover of a book. You clearly have a very creative eye. Well done.</td>', 'Not sure what the story is in this picture, however, I could easy see this photograph gracing the cover of a book. You clearly have a very creative eye. Well done.', '2008-05-09 23:31:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4693394, 675627, 12661, '<td valign="top">A story indeed. Somehow, I think the roles are reversed here however. I would imagine the guy walking down the street with a girl in a low cut shirt and knee high boots (ie, the fling) and the more conservatively sundress clad wife sitting on his smashed car with a hammer. Then again, I may be thinking of an entirely different story. But that aside, the composition and lighting are both very good. The puff of smoke is just icing on the cake.</td>', 'A story indeed. Somehow, I think the roles are reversed here however. I would imagine the guy walking down the street with a girl in a low cut shirt and knee high boots (ie, the fling) and the more conservatively sundress clad wife sitting on his smashed car with a hammer. Then again, I may be thinking of an entirely different story. But that aside, the composition and lighting are both very good. The puff of smoke is just icing on the cake.', '2008-05-09 23:36:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4693431, 675900, 86090, '<td valign="top">beautiful picture, I like the colors and lighting, nicely done</td>', 'beautiful picture, I like the colors and lighting, nicely done', '2008-05-09 23:54:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4693594, 674875, 12661, '<td valign="top">I like the chain in the bottom left. I didn''t even notice it until it just seemed to jump out at me after a few seconds.</td>', 'I like the chain in the bottom left. I didn''t even notice it until it just seemed to jump out at me after a few seconds.', '2008-05-10 01:43:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4693603, 676044, 12661, '<td valign="top">Brilliant idea. You definitely have a creative eye.</td>', 'Brilliant idea. You definitely have a creative eye.', '2008-05-10 01:46:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4693605, 676009, 12661, '<td valign="top">LOL. I can see this image on a motivational poster. Great job with the DOF and the sharpness of the subject.</td>', 'LOL. I can see this image on a motivational poster. Great job with the DOF and the sharpness of the subject.', '2008-05-10 01:48:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4693717, 676204, 3306, '<td valign="top">Interesting picture. I would have cropped it just below the writing on the cones to take out the distracting elements at the bottom of the picture and add some mystery as to how high the plane is flying.</td>', 'Interesting picture. I would have cropped it just below the writing on the cones to take out the distracting elements at the bottom of the picture and add some mystery as to how high the plane is flying.', '2008-05-10 05:40:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4693718, 675770, 3306, '<td valign="top">I''m sure there is a story to this one. Not a bad shot. Might look better desaturated.</td>', 'I''m sure there is a story to this one. Not a bad shot. Might look better desaturated.', '2008-05-10 05:46:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4693719, 675548, 3306, '<td valign="top">Quite an interesting macro.</td>', 'Quite an interesting macro.', '2008-05-10 05:46:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4693720, 675403, 3306, '<td valign="top">Good capture of his facial expression. Exposure and focus is right on.</td>', 'Good capture of his facial expression. Exposure and focus is right on.', '2008-05-10 05:48:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4693730, 676197, 66635, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture, but I''m not seeing a story here.</td>', 'Beautiful picture, but I''m not seeing a story here.', '2008-05-10 07:38:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4693777, 676150, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Nice catch with the sheep looking at the camera.  Like the unusual desaturation, although it seems a little odd on the man in the rear.  Such a small portion of the image (the sheep''s face/look) is key in this, that (although it still works as is) I wonder whether it would have been much stronger with a different crop, but difficult when the shears are at the other end of the frame.  Also be good to see the shearer''s face, but then that is ''another image'' - and I doubt you''d get the excellent look on the sheep''s face ''again''.  This one does tell a story - including how dirty that sheep looks...</td>', '6 - Nice catch with the sheep looking at the camera.  Like the unusual desaturation, although it seems a little odd on the man in the rear.  Such a small portion of the image (the sheep''s face/look) is key in this, that (although it still works as is) I wonder whether it would have been much stronger with a different crop, but difficult when the shears are at the other end of the frame.  Also be good to see the shearer''s face, but then that is ''another image'' - and I doubt you''d get the excellent look on the sheep''s face ''again''.  This one does tell a story - including how dirty that sheep looks...', '2008-05-10 09:08:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4693778, 676215, 39850, '<td valign="top">5 - Maybe he has a cork collection going..  Like your composition although wonder about a little more off the bottom.</td>', '5 - Maybe he has a cork collection going..  Like your composition although wonder about a little more off the bottom.', '2008-05-10 09:10:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4693818, 676142, 68573, '<td valign="top">I find the picture a little weak and even the relevance with the theme is not very clear</td>', 'I find the picture a little weak and even the relevance with the theme is not very clear', '2008-05-10 10:35:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4693819, 676107, 68573, '<td valign="top">Great concept and good execution. The BW looks good though i feel the left part is too dark and doesn''t add much to the composition</td>', 'Great concept and good execution. The BW looks good though i feel the left part is too dark and doesn''t add much to the composition', '2008-05-10 10:36:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4693821, 675801, 68573, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and great shadows, maybe the lighted cigar should have added more drama to it ( or maybe he is waiting for someone to light it up! Its a story afterall:))</td>', 'Nice lighting and great shadows, maybe the lighted cigar should have added more drama to it ( or maybe he is waiting for someone to light it up! Its a story afterall:))', '2008-05-10 10:37:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4693822, 676027, 68573, '<td valign="top">Nice shot for this challenge. I can see lot of pride and happiness on the face of the model and it relates to the title so well</td>', 'Nice shot for this challenge. I can see lot of pride and happiness on the face of the model and it relates to the title so well', '2008-05-10 10:38:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4693823, 675777, 68573, '<td valign="top">Very nice image and yes it tells a lot many stories. I like the PP which makes tis really stand out</td>', 'Very nice image and yes it tells a lot many stories. I like the PP which makes tis really stand out', '2008-05-10 10:39:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4693825, 673845, 68573, '<td valign="top">wonderful theme and great tones. Indeed very beautiful</td>', 'wonderful theme and great tones. Indeed very beautiful', '2008-05-10 10:40:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4693827, 676193, 68573, '<td valign="top">Nice moment to capture , the expressions are wonderful and suits well with the theme. I do feel that the image has been processed a bit too much as the face look a bit too softened at places. 7</td>', 'Nice moment to capture , the expressions are wonderful and suits well with the theme. I do feel that the image has been processed a bit too much as the face look a bit too softened at places. 7', '2008-05-10 10:45:12.000000', NULL, 1),
