(4694241, 675179, 47852, '<td valign="top">I like the idea here, and the black and white is nicely done.  I think the couple sitting could be just a tad more in focus to help tell the story.  I think its the black stripe in his shirt that threw me off trying to tell what the shapes were.</td>', 'I like the idea here, and the black and white is nicely done.  I think the couple sitting could be just a tad more in focus to help tell the story.  I think its the black stripe in his shirt that threw me off trying to tell what the shapes were.', '2008-05-10 21:03:46.000000', NULL, 1),
