(4694504, 676064, 53062, '<td valign="top">I like the idea and this photo told story. Prefer make some burning on the top so the child was hiding in the case more outstanding.</td>', 'I like the idea and this photo told story. Prefer make some burning on the top so the child was hiding in the case more outstanding.', '2008-05-11 02:48:51.000000', NULL, 1),
