(4694643, 676064, 68573, '<td valign="top">Very nice idea and a great execution. Everything looks so perfect in the shot. I am sure this will be atleast in the top 10</td>', 'Very nice idea and a great execution. Everything looks so perfect in the shot. I am sure this will be atleast in the top 10', '2008-05-11 09:21:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4694644, 675627, 68573, '<td valign="top">lol,this looks like a complete story in one frame. So full of drama, revenge, glamour and violence.  great setup and a wonderful justice to the theme. 10</td>', 'lol,this looks like a complete story in one frame. So full of drama, revenge, glamour and violence.  great setup and a wonderful justice to the theme. 10', '2008-05-11 09:46:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4694671, 674352, 53572, '<td valign="top">Hemingway''s most heartbreaking story.  Well done.</td>', 'Hemingway''s most heartbreaking story.  Well done.', '2008-05-11 10:39:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4694694, 675997, 53572, '<td valign="top">o, this makes me homesick...  nice shot.</td>', 'o, this makes me homesick...  nice shot.', '2008-05-11 11:10:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4694787, 676124, 83080, '<td valign="top">Well done with great detail and composition.  My first reaction before looking at the title was a little sad as I thought about the liklihood the runt will not survive, so I imagined the story/title would have something to do with the runt''s plight.  Hope I''m not raining on your optimistic title, just thought you might appreciate my alternate reaction.  Powerful photo overall that tells an interesting story.</td>', 'Well done with great detail and composition.  My first reaction before looking at the title was a little sad as I thought about the liklihood the runt will not survive, so I imagined the story/title would have something to do with the runt''s plight.  Hope I''m not raining on your optimistic title, just thought you might appreciate my alternate reaction.  Powerful photo overall that tells an interesting story.', '2008-05-11 13:02:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4694794, 676031, 83080, '<td valign="top">LOL!  Well captured, great sense of motion while keeping the subject sharp, and fantastic title.</td>', 'LOL!  Well captured, great sense of motion while keeping the subject sharp, and fantastic title.', '2008-05-11 13:05:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4694834, 675222, 83080, '<td valign="top">I like the interesting angles you used in this.  I hope the bandages/cast are just props, but somehow I suspect there''s a real story here.</td>', 'I like the interesting angles you used in this.  I hope the bandages/cast are just props, but somehow I suspect there''s a real story here.', '2008-05-11 13:42:09.000000', NULL, 1),
