(4695124, 675973, 39427, '<td valign="top">i''m giving you a 10 to counteract one of the 1''s that i''m sure you''ll be getting a lot of from the easily offended :P  Would still give it a high rating b/c the lighting is really nice and this picture is hot, though I would say it leans a tad toward the pornographic.</td>', 'i''m giving you a 10 to counteract one of the 1''s that i''m sure you''ll be getting a lot of from the easily offended :P  Would still give it a high rating b/c the lighting is really nice and this picture is hot, though I would say it leans a tad toward the pornographic.', '2008-05-11 20:00:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4695149, 676014, 76335, '<td valign="top">I''m probably not the first (or last) to tell you that the image is too small. That aside, this doesn''t tell a strong story on its own.</td>', 'I''m probably not the first (or last) to tell you that the image is too small. That aside, this doesn''t tell a strong story on its own.', '2008-05-11 20:21:25.000000', NULL, 1),
