(4695291, 675732, 15711, '<td valign="top">This one does tell a story yet it leaves it up to the imagination of the viewer.  One of the more imaginative takes on the challenge. I like it.</td>', 'This one does tell a story yet it leaves it up to the imagination of the viewer.  One of the more imaginative takes on the challenge. I like it.', '2008-05-11 22:05:48.000000', NULL, 1),
