(4695769, 675621, 66384, '<td valign="top">This person was obviously having a very difficult moment, but I find it very hard to understand what is happening. I thought it was a man, but of course that doesn''t matter. There is something in her hand I can''t identify and I can''t tell why she is contorted. The thing about the shot that is most interesting to me is the crowd in the background that is oblivious the this occurrence. I guess what I''m saying is that this is definitely telling a story, but I don''t know what the story is.</td>', 'This person was obviously having a very difficult moment, but I find it very hard to understand what is happening. I thought it was a man, but of course that doesn''t matter. There is something in her hand I can''t identify and I can''t tell why she is contorted. The thing about the shot that is most interesting to me is the crowd in the background that is oblivious the this occurrence. I guess what I''m saying is that this is definitely telling a story, but I don''t know what the story is.', '2008-05-12 01:42:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(4695790, 676150, 66384, '<td valign="top">I like the almost 3-D effect you achieved with the processing. And I like the look on the sheep''s face as it peers out from its compromised position. (edited for typo)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-05-12 00:50:31.</i></td>', 'I like the almost 3-D effect you achieved with the processing. And I like the look on the sheep''s face as it peers out from its compromised position. (edited for typo)', '2008-05-12 01:49:12.000000', '2008-05-12 01:50:31.000000', 0),
(4695814, 675261, 62249, '<td valign="top">Your facial expression is just right. Love the hole in the sock, too.</td>', 'Your facial expression is just right. Love the hole in the sock, too.', '2008-05-12 01:58:39.000000', NULL, 0),
