(4696259, 676198, 68035, '<td valign="top">Ron!!!!<br/> <br/>Many congratulations of the top ten finish, which I thought was thoroughly deserved.  This shot met the challenge perfectly<br/> <br/>I love the lighting on Kris''s face (and the understated but clever lighting on the roses) and the wonderful expressions/body language on all the subjects<br/> <br/>A very evocative image and more pwer to you for having been able to pull it together so brilliantly<br/> <br/>This goes beyong photography and into the realms of story telling which is exactly what was required<br/> <br/>Perfect</td>', 'Ron!!!! Many congratulations of the top ten finish, which I thought was thoroughly deserved.  This shot met the challenge perfectly I love the lighting on Kris''s face (and the understated but clever lighting on the roses) and the wonderful expressions/body language on all the subjects A very evocative image and more pwer to you for having been able to pull it together so brilliantly This goes beyong photography and into the realms of story telling which is exactly what was required Perfect', '2008-05-12 07:09:32.000000', NULL, 0),
