(4696295, 675917, 53572, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=657241" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/657241.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/657241.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/657241.jpg"/></a> this is superb, the darks and lights, the stunning gold colour.  the harsh angles and flat areas of shadow.  and of course the bird and the anarchy.  the strict regimen of the structure reinforces the concept of conformity, while the tiny bird and faint anarchy symbol are the just the right amount of corrupting influence.  a lovely image that can be read on many levels.</td>', ' this is superb, the darks and lights, the stunning gold colour.  the harsh angles and flat areas of shadow.  and of course the bird and the anarchy.  the strict regimen of the structure reinforces the concept of conformity, while the tiny bird and faint anarchy symbol are the just the right amount of corrupting influence.  a lovely image that can be read on many levels.', '2008-05-12 07:49:42.000000', NULL, 0),
