(4696453, 676088, 53572, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=657242" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/657242.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/657242.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/657242.jpg"/></a>I really liked this one - the shallow depth of field, the deep tones, and the melancholy, subtle story implied in the mundane objects. the composition is dynamic yet quiet, and the whole thing has a warm, sad feeling.  well done indeed.</td>', 'I really liked this one - the shallow depth of field, the deep tones, and the melancholy, subtle story implied in the mundane objects. the composition is dynamic yet quiet, and the whole thing has a warm, sad feeling.  well done indeed.', '2008-05-12 09:18:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(4696457, 674668, 53572, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=657243" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/657243.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/657243.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/657243.jpg"/></a> i''m not always a fan of selective desat, but it works really well here.  was i influenced by the fact that it''s obviously africa?  maybe.  but the tones and composition really work well here, the emptiness in the middle of chaos just make it.  the implied line leading from coke, through cat to dog energise the whole piece, in a quiet and slightly menacing way.</td>', ' i''m not always a fan of selective desat, but it works really well here.  was i influenced by the fact that it''s obviously africa?  maybe.  but the tones and composition really work well here, the emptiness in the middle of chaos just make it.  the implied line leading from coke, through cat to dog energise the whole piece, in a quiet and slightly menacing way.', '2008-05-12 09:20:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(4696460, 676208, 53572, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=657243" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/657243.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/657243.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/657243.jpg"/></a> i really like word play, and the fact that i could read the title in two ways.  the dark tones and blue work against the concept of light so well, accentuating the not only the bar of light on his face, but also the dark emotion of the image.  not only does he look like he''s crying light (the interpretation i actually didn''t get on first viewing) but the jagged edges in the light remind me of sharp teeth, calling up the boy who cried wolf.</td>', ' i really like word play, and the fact that i could read the title in two ways.  the dark tones and blue work against the concept of light so well, accentuating the not only the bar of light on his face, but also the dark emotion of the image.  not only does he look like he''s crying light (the interpretation i actually didn''t get on first viewing) but the jagged edges in the light remind me of sharp teeth, calling up the boy who cried wolf.', '2008-05-12 09:20:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(4696465, 676174, 53572, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=657243" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/657243.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/657243.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/657243.jpg"/></a> a lovely, quiet, yet not at all subtle image.  the tones, the deep melancholy, all work so well.  a true portrait or the animal, and of yearning.<br/></td>', ' a lovely, quiet, yet not at all subtle image.  the tones, the deep melancholy, all work so well.  a true portrait or the animal, and of yearning.', '2008-05-12 09:22:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(4696469, 674352, 53572, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=657243" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/657243.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/657243.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/657243.jpg"/></a> you had to get a top mark for using Hemingway''s story , and the fact that you made top twenty in the rankings is icing on the cake.</td>', ' you had to get a top mark for using Hemingway''s story , and the fact that you made top twenty in the rankings is icing on the cake.', '2008-05-12 09:23:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(4696475, 675261, 53572, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=657243" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/657243.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/657243.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/657243.jpg"/></a> thank you tim, for making me laugh (schadenfreude?).  my screen doesn''t thank you quite so much...  although i did have to clean it...</td>', ' thank you tim, for making me laugh (schadenfreude?).  my screen doesn''t thank you quite so much...  although i did have to clean it...', '2008-05-12 09:25:27.000000', NULL, 0),
