(4696498, 676136, 92383, '<td valign="top">So honestly I was out shooting after work.  I thought I would see what I could do trying to capture the sun through the stained glass.  The relatively few shots I was able to get of the sun through the glass didn''t quite cut it.  Afterward, I went through and figured I could shoehorn it in the story challenge.<br/> <br/>In hindsight, The glass would have been ok to use for sunlight, as the sunlight would have been my subject.  This really fared just as it should have.</td>', 'So honestly I was out shooting after work.  I thought I would see what I could do trying to capture the sun through the stained glass.  The relatively few shots I was able to get of the sun through the glass didn''t quite cut it.  Afterward, I went through and figured I could shoehorn it in the story challenge. In hindsight, The glass would have been ok to use for sunlight, as the sunlight would have been my subject.  This really fared just as it should have.', '2008-05-12 09:35:17.000000', NULL, 0),
