(4697448, 676115, 66384, '<td valign="top">Very interesting instrument. I''ve never seen anything like it. You got just enough of the costume into the shot to convey an Asian feel. I like the diagonal composition.</td>', 'Very interesting instrument. I''ve never seen anything like it. You got just enough of the costume into the shot to convey an Asian feel. I like the diagonal composition.', '2008-05-12 15:28:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(4697466, 676142, 66384, '<td valign="top">This IS odd. I''d think the pool would come first, then the slide. Hope there are no kids around now to try it out. The image quality seems a little lifeless. I noticed that you used Highlights/Shadows. I find that often seems to flatten the image. When that happens, I like to follow up with an Exposure adjustment, reducing the Offset just a little, and increasing the Gamma just a little. That brings the photo back to life. Anyway this is a fun capture -- makes you wonder.</td>', 'This IS odd. I''d think the pool would come first, then the slide. Hope there are no kids around now to try it out. The image quality seems a little lifeless. I noticed that you used Highlights/Shadows. I find that often seems to flatten the image. When that happens, I like to follow up with an Exposure adjustment, reducing the Offset just a little, and increasing the Gamma just a little. That brings the photo back to life. Anyway this is a fun capture -- makes you wonder.', '2008-05-12 15:37:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(4697473, 676157, 92309, '<td valign="top">I love this photo, I think that the eyes are a bit our of focus imo!<br/> <br/>Evan <br/> <br/>PS defiantly a keeper though!</td>', 'I love this photo, I think that the eyes are a bit our of focus imo! Evan  PS defiantly a keeper though!', '2008-05-12 15:42:59.000000', NULL, 0),
