(4701112, 675973, 48954, '<td valign="top">holy crap. It took me 10 views to figure out what''s going on. For some reason i thought the girl on the right was seeing her future on the glass table where she was snorting coke. Where the hell did I get that from? Damn. Freudian slip maybe haha. This image was so abstract for me. Not anymore though. Now I get. I need to get my head checked. Love the shot by the way</td>', 'holy crap. It took me 10 views to figure out what''s going on. For some reason i thought the girl on the right was seeing her future on the glass table where she was snorting coke. Where the hell did I get that from? Damn. Freudian slip maybe haha. This image was so abstract for me. Not anymore though. Now I get. I need to get my head checked. Love the shot by the way', '2008-05-14 04:58:23.000000', NULL, 0),
