(4701565, 675860, 67697, '<td valign="top">What I liked about this one was that it reminded me of a scene at Grandma''s house.  She''s baked the cookies and they are sitting out to cool.  And of course someone already snuck in and took some :)  I love the beautiful soft light in this photo too.</td>', 'What I liked about this one was that it reminded me of a scene at Grandma''s house.  She''s baked the cookies and they are sitting out to cool.  And of course someone already snuck in and took some :)  I love the beautiful soft light in this photo too.', '2008-05-14 10:34:31.000000', NULL, 0),
