(4701908, 676161, 51538, '<td valign="top">OK.  Now I understand.  That tunnel has a lot to do with the snow pack melting so fast these days in the mountains that the old small bore pipes can no longer deal with the spring torrents and a lot of water is being lost.  Hence they are changing the water system to make it possible to collect fast flowing melt water.  England-France - the Channel Tunnel was pretty large too.</td>', 'OK.  Now I understand.  That tunnel has a lot to do with the snow pack melting so fast these days in the mountains that the old small bore pipes can no longer deal with the spring torrents and a lot of water is being lost.  Hence they are changing the water system to make it possible to collect fast flowing melt water.  England-France - the Channel Tunnel was pretty large too.', '2008-05-14 12:20:11.000000', NULL, 0),
