(4702120, 675778, 39218, '<td valign="top">I love the laugh, I love the rain, and I LOVE the spontaneous nature of this pic.<br/> <br/>Becky''s haircut looks great, and I bet her Mom LOVES this pic!<br/> <br/></td>', 'I love the laugh, I love the rain, and I LOVE the spontaneous nature of this pic. Becky''s haircut looks great, and I bet her Mom LOVES this pic! ', '2008-05-14 14:47:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(4702127, 675848, 39218, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by posthumous:</b></div><hr/><i> Nana took one last look at her scrapbook and closed it up again, as her grandchildren came into the room. They begged her to look at it, but she refused, as always. She told them that they would only be disappointed, that this was just her childhood, more ordinary than theirs.<br/> <br/>What they didn''t know was that there was not a single photograph in this "chapbook," just pages and pages of formulae and diagrams. Nobody would ever think to look for it here... </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>PURE GENIUS!  I laughed...<br/> <br/>In all seriousness though, your mother is precious.  This is really nostalgic to me and the memory of my own beautiful Grandmother...   Would love to see this cropped closer to the top of her head to avoid noticing the wrinkles in the backdrop, as well as less of the arm of the chair, right about the area where the blue under the book is showing...</td>', 'Originally posted by posthumous: Nana took one last look at her scrapbook and closed it up again, as her grandchildren came into the room. They begged her to look at it, but she refused, as always. She told them that they would only be disappointed, that this was just her childhood, more ordinary than theirs. What they didn''t know was that there was not a single photograph in this "chapbook," just pages and pages of formulae and diagrams. Nobody would ever think to look for it here...   PURE GENIUS!  I laughed... In all seriousness though, your mother is precious.  This is really nostalgic to me and the memory of my own beautiful Grandmother...   Would love to see this cropped closer to the top of her head to avoid noticing the wrinkles in the backdrop, as well as less of the arm of the chair, right about the area where the blue under the book is showing...', '2008-05-14 14:54:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(4702132, 675960, 39218, '<td valign="top">I like the way it feels like these two pairs of shoes shouldn''t be walking together, yet they are!  It tells ME a story...</td>', 'I like the way it feels like these two pairs of shoes shouldn''t be walking together, yet they are!  It tells ME a story...', '2008-05-14 14:57:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(4702144, 675622, 39218, '<td valign="top">This is an amazing story!<br/> <br/>Would have loved to have seen the shoes be very sexy, higer heels, and facing you.  I love the flowing skirt and the way her bare foot crosses over to come toward you.</td>', 'This is an amazing story! Would have loved to have seen the shoes be very sexy, higer heels, and facing you.  I love the flowing skirt and the way her bare foot crosses over to come toward you.', '2008-05-14 15:02:13.000000', NULL, 0),
