(4706939, 676064, 44741, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of a few occasions during college when I went home to visit my parents. As soon as I set out the luggage to pack up for the return trip, I''d find my dog in it five minutes later. He always wanted to come with me.<br/> <br/>Great photo!</td>', 'Reminds me of a few occasions during college when I went home to visit my parents. As soon as I set out the luggage to pack up for the return trip, I''d find my dog in it five minutes later. He always wanted to come with me. Great photo!', '2008-05-16 15:29:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(4707142, 675401, 64568, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot Leo and well deserved blue. I know exactly what you mean with your story. I was at my younger daughters''(11yrs) football tournament last saturday, watching with my wife and older daughter (12yrs). Around halfway through the day, my wife asked my daughter to tell me what had happened at school during a talk she gave in front of her class on a piece of work all the kids had to do. It was titled--Who I look upto the Most!...and her response was ME.!!!!..I felt so proud and emotional. ;-)....your little one will always see you as a hero..no matter how old he gets ;-)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-05-16 18:04:36.</i></td>', 'Excellent shot Leo and well deserved blue. I know exactly what you mean with your story. I was at my younger daughters''(11yrs) football tournament last saturday, watching with my wife and older daughter (12yrs). Around halfway through the day, my wife asked my daughter to tell me what had happened at school during a talk she gave in front of her class on a piece of work all the kids had to do. It was titled--Who I look upto the Most!...and her response was ME.!!!!..I felt so proud and emotional. ;-)....your little one will always see you as a hero..no matter how old he gets ;-)', '2008-05-16 17:53:16.000000', '2008-05-16 19:04:36.000000', 0),
(4707201, 674652, 64568, '<td valign="top">cool shot, nice work very creative</td>', 'cool shot, nice work very creative', '2008-05-16 18:52:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(4707462, 676010, 79955, '<td valign="top">Joe another darn good shot! Would have like a tighter crop to minimize the visibility of the wires though. They are a too distracting.</td>', 'Joe another darn good shot! Would have like a tighter crop to minimize the visibility of the wires though. They are a too distracting.', '2008-05-16 21:30:00.000000', NULL, 0),
