(4710587, 675372, 34659, '<td valign="top">Dude - this speaks to me on a number of levels, but mostly on the one that is most desperate and needy.  Don''t get me wrong - I think this is a brilliant piece of work.  There''s a lot going on here and I think you portrayed it well.  I imagine a lot more additional strong work from you - can''t wait to see it.</td>', 'Dude - this speaks to me on a number of levels, but mostly on the one that is most desperate and needy.  Don''t get me wrong - I think this is a brilliant piece of work.  There''s a lot going on here and I think you portrayed it well.  I imagine a lot more additional strong work from you - can''t wait to see it.', '2008-05-19 02:03:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(4711117, 675859, 67697, '<td valign="top">lol I really had no idea that Japan was filled with so many interesting characters.  Look at those pompadours.  What a scream!</td>', 'lol I really had no idea that Japan was filled with so many interesting characters.  Look at those pompadours.  What a scream!', '2008-05-19 10:59:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(4711144, 676040, 67697, '<td valign="top">I laughed when I saw this because I have a picture of the boys posing with a guy dressed like this.  His job was to dress like that and go to birthday parties.  The kids were excited about that but the guy creeped me out lol. <br/> <br/>You did a good job with capturing the details in the white areas of the costume.  Good clarity and focus on that too.</td>', 'I laughed when I saw this because I have a picture of the boys posing with a guy dressed like this.  His job was to dress like that and go to birthday parties.  The kids were excited about that but the guy creeped me out lol.  You did a good job with capturing the details in the white areas of the costume.  Good clarity and focus on that too.', '2008-05-19 11:13:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(4712063, 675627, 28742, '<td valign="top">A sledge and the title "Hell Hath No Fury..." - other than that, this kicks! Great job.</td>', 'A sledge and the title "Hell Hath No Fury..." - other than that, this kicks! Great job.', '2008-05-19 21:09:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(4713689, 675927, 90414, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Dirt_Diver:</b></div><hr/><i> I have seen this before in a past picture. Not sure if it was you or not but I know I''ve seen it. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Nope, not me Dirt Diver. This was my first submission of this nature.</td>', 'Originally posted by Dirt_Diver: I have seen this before in a past picture. Not sure if it was you or not but I know I''ve seen it.   Nope, not me Dirt Diver. This was my first submission of this nature.', '2008-05-20 23:11:17.000000', NULL, 0),
