(4716766, 675973, 46601, '<td valign="top">absolutely amazing ... one of those shots that really stands out on this site .. keep up the good work and keep on posting quality shots like this!</td>', 'absolutely amazing ... one of those shots that really stands out on this site .. keep up the good work and keep on posting quality shots like this!', '2008-05-22 01:29:42.000000', NULL, 0),
