(4747716, 675401, 94024, '<td valign="top">wow i''m new on this site. i was lookin your portfolios and you inspired me to take more and more pictures this one is supergreat thanks for your great job!</td>', 'wow i''m new on this site. i was lookin your portfolios and you inspired me to take more and more pictures this one is supergreat thanks for your great job!', '2008-06-04 09:25:46.000000', NULL, 0),
