(4761584, 675401, 94073, '<td valign="top">absolutely amazing...and you can only realize its true intensity if you are a father.<br/> <br/>It is so cute how sons want to be just like their dads. My son is only 1 and he tries to copy EVERYTHING that I do.<br/> <br/>This photo touched me. Bravo.</td>', 'absolutely amazing...and you can only realize its true intensity if you are a father. It is so cute how sons want to be just like their dads. My son is only 1 and he tries to copy EVERYTHING that I do. This photo touched me. Bravo.', '2008-06-10 14:38:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(4771935, 675737, 32933, '<td valign="top">Everything should be made as simple as possible, but not one bit simpler.<br/>    Albert Einstein<br/> <br/>Go confidently in the direction of your dreams! Live the life you''ve imagined. As you simplify your life, the laws of the universe will be simpler.<br/>    Henry David Thoreau<br/> <br/>Seek simplicity, and distrust it.<br/>    Alfred North Whitehead<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-06-16 22:09:21.</i></td>', 'Everything should be made as simple as possible, but not one bit simpler.    Albert Einstein Go confidently in the direction of your dreams! Live the life you''ve imagined. As you simplify your life, the laws of the universe will be simpler.    Henry David Thoreau Seek simplicity, and distrust it.    Alfred North Whitehead', '2008-06-16 23:06:57.000000', '2008-06-16 23:09:21.000000', 0),
(4771988, 675737, 32933, '<td valign="top">I have to wonder if I got as many 1''s as I did, simply because of the subjects of the photograph and the simplicity of the title.<br/> <br/>If so, I''m sorry, but I simply can''t stop smiling. My ex was so incredibly right about photographers being stuck-up and prudish...</td>', 'I have to wonder if I got as many 1''s as I did, simply because of the subjects of the photograph and the simplicity of the title. If so, I''m sorry, but I simply can''t stop smiling. My ex was so incredibly right about photographers being stuck-up and prudish...', '2008-06-16 23:34:15.000000', NULL, 0),
